-- WITHIN d OF THE JOIN under LEST: the LEST runs because the enclosing
-- obligation was NOT completed — its join did not fire — so there is no
-- instant to count from. Refused (EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §5.1.1: the
-- conservative reading of the question the ruling left open, a build
-- decision of 2026-09-15). Under LEST, anchor to THE DEADLINE or THE ARMING.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Buyer
    Seller

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay
    Deliver

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS
    PARTY Buyer MUST Pay WITHIN 10
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  (PARTY Seller MUST Deliver WITHIN 5 OF THE JOIN)
